      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "These panels show the raw flags the car sends. The `events_faults` processor publishes only the changes, one `fault_raised` and one `fault_cleared` per fault, to the Kafka topic `fault_events`. Grafana cannot read that topic yet, so watch it in a terminal:\n\n```\n./apps/telemetry/stack/server_devtool.sh enable events_faults\ndocker exec kafka /opt/kafka/bin/kafka-console-consumer.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:29092 --topic fault_events\n```"
      }
